      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia alipomaliza kuwaambia watu wote maneno yote ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wao, alimwamuru awatangazie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azaria mwana wa Hoshaia, Yohanani mwana wa Karea na watu wote mafidhuli, walimwambia Yeremia: “Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, hakukutuma wewe utuambie tusiende Misri, tukaishi huko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baruku mwana wa Neria, amekuchochea dhidi yetu ili tutiwe mikononi mwa Wakaldayo watuue au watupeleke uhamishoni Babuloni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yohanani mwana wa Karea na makamanda wote wa majeshi pamoja na watu wote hawakutii aliyosema Mwenyezi-Mungu, kwamba wabaki katika nchi ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo Yohanani mwana wa Karea na makamanda wote wa majeshi waliwachukua watu wote wa Yuda waliosalia ambao walikuwa wamerudi nchini Yuda kutoka mataifa yote ambako walikuwa wametawanywa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wanaume, wanawake, watoto, binti za mfalme na kila mtu ambaye Nebuzaradani, kapteni wa walinzi, alikuwa amemwachia Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, mjukuu wa Shafani, wakamchukua pia nabii Yeremia na Baruku mwana wa Neria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakaenda nchini Misri, wakawasili mjini Tahpanesi. Ndivyo walivyokataa kutii alichosema Mwenyezi-Mungu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu likamjia Yeremia huko Tahpanesi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Chukua mawe makubwa, ukayafiche katika chokaa ya matofali kwenye lango la ikulu ya Farao mjini Tahpanesi, watu wa Yuda wakiwa wanaona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha waambie hivi: Tazameni mimi nitamtuma na kumleta Nebukadneza, mfalme wa Babuloni, mtumishi wangu, naye ataweka kiti chake cha enzi juu ya mawe haya ambayo nimeyaficha hapa, na kutandaza paa la kifalme juu yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atakapofika ataiangamiza nchi ya Misri. Hapo waliopangiwa kufa kwa maradhi watakufa kwa maradhi, waliopangiwa kuchukuliwa mateka, watachukuliwa mateka; waliopangiwa kufia vitani watafia vitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi nitawasha moto katika mahekalu ya miungu ya Misri; naye Nebukadneza ataiteketeza miungu hiyo kwa moto au kuichukua mateka mpaka Babuloni. Ataisafisha nchi ya Misri kama mchungaji atoavyo kupe katika vazi lake na kuondoka Misri akiwa mshindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ataivunja minara ya ukumbusho iliyoko huko Heliopoli nchini Misri, na mahekalu ya miungu ya Misri atayateketeza kwa moto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
